helpcontent2	source\text\swriter\guide\header_with_chapter.xhp	0	help	par_id3146863	9			0	pt	Escolha \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Inserir - Campos - Outros\</item\> e clique no separador\<emph/\>               \<item type=\"menuitem\"\>Documento\</item\>.				20130618 17:22:18
