helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3154792	20			0	pt	If dataC < hojeC Then				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3155601	21			0	pt	MsgBox "A data de expiração já passou"				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\sbasic\shared\03090101.xhp	0	help	par_id3146972	22			0	pt	ElseIf dataC > hojeC Then				20130618 17:22:18
