helpcontent2	source\text\simpress\guide\animated_gif_save.xhp	0	help	par_id3155064	79			0	pt	Selecione \<emph\>GIF - Graphics Interchange Format (.gif)\</emph\> na lista \<emph\>Tipo de ficheiro\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
