helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\guide\scenario.xhp	0	help	par_id3150752	12			0	pt	Abra o Navegador através do ícone \<emph\>Navegador\</emph\> \<image id=\"img_id1593676\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_navigator.png\" width=\"0.1665inch\" height=\"0.1665inch\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id1593676\"\>ícone Navegador\</alt\>\</image\> na barra Padrão.				20130618 17:22:18
