helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id5752128				0	pt	Para devolver a tangente de um ângulo em graus, utilize a função RADIANOS.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	hd_id3152287	451			0	pt	Exemplo				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id3152301	452			0	pt	\<item type=\"input\"\>=TAN(PI()/4) \</item\>devolve 1, a tangente em radianos de PI/4.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\scalc\01\04060106.xhp	0	help	par_id1804864				0	pt	\<item type=\"input\"\>=TAN(RADIANOS(45))\</item\> devolve 1, a tangente de 45 graus.				20130618 17:22:18
