helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_idN106E8				0	pt	No Painel de Controlo, clique em \<emph\>Adicionar ou Remover Programas\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\activex.xhp	0	help	par_id3156155	6			0	pt	Na lista, clique em %PRODUCTNAME e clique em \<emph\>Alterar\</emph\>.				20130618 17:22:18
