helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3151176	91			0	pt	Clique no ícone \<emph\>Criar consulta na vista de SQL\</emph\> \<image id=\"img_id3154071\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbnewquerysql.png\" width=\"0.1862in\" height=\"0.1862in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3154071\"\>Ícone\</alt\>\</image\> ou				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3145786	92			0	pt	Selecione uma consulta existente na lista e clique no ícone \<emph\>Editar\</emph\> \<image id=\"img_id3156212\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_dbqueryedit.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3156212\"\>Ícone\</alt\>\</image\>.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3083443	94			0	pt	Na janela \<emph\>Consulta\</emph\>, escolha \<emph\>Ver - Ativar/desativar vista de desenho\</emph\>. Edite o comando SQL.				20130618 17:22:18
helpcontent2	source\text\shared\guide\data_enter_sql.xhp	0	help	par_id3152460	96			0	pt	Clique no ícone \<emph\>Executar\</emph\> \<image id=\"img_id3152886\" src=\"res/commandimagelist/sc_sbanativesql.png\" width=\"0.2228in\" height=\"0.2228in\"\>\<alt id=\"alt_id3152886\"\>Ícone\</alt\>\</image\>. O resultado da consulta é mostrado na janela localizada mais acima.				20130618 17:22:18
